---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHead from '../components/PageHead.astro';
import { allPartners } from '../lib/partners';
import { withBase } from '../lib/url';
const list = allPartners();
---
<Base title="Affiliate disclosure" description="How Lot & Lounge makes money: we may earn a commission from partners such as Stay22 and Travelpayouts brands, at no extra cost to you. It never changes our prices." path="affiliate-disclosure/">
  <PageHead title="Affiliate disclosure" eyebrow="Transparency" />
  <div class="wrap"><div class="prose read page-body">
    <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> 22 Nov 2026</p>
    <p>Lot &amp; Lounge earns money through affiliate commissions. If you click a link on this site and then book, the company you book with may pay us a commission. It costs you nothing extra.</p>

    <h2 id="networks">Affiliate networks on this site</h2>
    <p>Every page loads scripts from two affiliate networks. They can automatically turn some travel and hotel links into affiliate links, so you may not be able to tell from the link itself:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Stay22</strong>, for hotel and accommodation links.</li>
      <li><strong>Travelpayouts</strong>, for links to its partner travel brands.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>So we may earn a commission from partners including Stay22 and Travelpayouts partner brands. What those scripts may collect is explained in our <a href={withBase('privacy/')}>privacy policy</a>.</p>

    <h2 id="partners">Partners we name on airport pages</h2>
    <p>These are the links in the "Compare and book" box on airport pages. We mark each one as an affiliate link once a program approves us:</p>
    <ul>
      {list.map((p) => <li>{p.name}: {p.affiliate ? 'affiliate link' : 'no direct affiliate deal yet (the link may still be converted by the networks above)'}</li>)}
    </ul>
    <p>By the way: Voyaij, the travel app we feature, is run by someone close to us. We recommend it because we use it, but we wanted you to know.</p>

    <h2 id="independence">What commissions never change</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>The official rates we publish, or the order of the cheapest options.</li>
      <li>Official airport-run parking is always listed, even when no one pays us for it.</li>
      <li>We don't recommend credit cards or other financial products.</li>
    </ul>
  </div></div>
</Base>
